    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "### Neovim Version\r\n\r\n```\r\nNVIM v0.5.0\r\nBuild type: Release\r\nLua 5.1\r\nCompilation: /usr/bin/cc -g -O2 -ffile-prefix-map=/home/jamessan/neovim-0.5.0=. -fstack-protector-strong -Wformat -Werror=format-security -Wdate-time -D_FORTIFY_SOURCE=1 -DDISABLE_LOG -Wdate-time -D_FORTIFY_SOURCE=1 -DNVIM_TS_HAS_SET_MATCH_LIMIT -O2 -DNDEBUG -Wall -Wextra -pedantic -Wno-unused-parameter -Wstrict-prototypes -std=gnu99 -Wshadow -Wconversion -Wmissing-prototypes -Wimplicit-fallthrough -Wvla -fstack-protector-strong -fno-common -fdiagnostics-color=always -DINCLUDE_GENERATED_DECLARATIONS -D_GNU_SOURCE -DNVIM_MSGPACK_HAS_FLOAT32 -DNVIM_UNIBI_HAS_VAR_FROM -DMIN_LOG_LEVEL=3 -I/home/jamessan/neovim-0.5.0/build/config -I/home/jamessan/neovim-0.5.0/src -I/usr/include -I/usr/include/lua5.1 -I/home/jamessan/neovim-0.5.0/build/src/nvim/auto -I/home/jamessan/neovim-0.5.0/build/include\r\nCompiled by team+vim@tracker.debian.org\r\nFeatures: +acl +iconv +tui\r\nSee \":help feature-compile\"\r\n\r\n    system vimrc file: \"$VIM/sysinit.vim\"\r\n   fall-back for $VIM: \"/usr/share/nvim\"\r\n\r\nRun :checkhealth for more info\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Operating system/version:\r\n\r\nDebian/sid\r\n\r\n### Terminal name/version:\r\n\r\nkitty 0.19.3\r\n\r\n### TERM environment variable\r\n\r\nxterm-kitty\r\n\r\n### Installation\r\n\r\nbuild from repo\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nRun `test/functional/autocmd/termxx_spec.lua` and sometimes it will hang in the `autocmd TermClose reports the correct <abuf>` test.\r\n\r\n### Vim\r\n\r\nn/a\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nNo hang\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\n\r\nNvim gets stuck in a loop queuing `term_delayed_free` while it waits for the PtyProcess' `chan.stream.in.pending_reqs` to go to 0.\r\n\r\n```\r\n#0  0x0000aaaac3c434a0 in multiqueue_push (event=..., this=0xaaaade675a20) at ../src/nvim/event/multiqueue.c:248\r\n#1  multiqueue_put_event (this=0xaaaade675a20, event=<error reading variable: Cannot access memory at address 0x90389f60>) at ../src/nvim/event/multiqueue.c:145\r\n#2  0x0000aaaac3bdec10 in term_delayed_free (argv=<optimized out>) at ../src/nvim/channel.c:778\r\n#3  0x0000aaaac3dbc50c in state_handle_k_event () at ../src/nvim/state.c:87\r\n#4  0x0000aaaac3d158ec in nv_event (cap=0xfffffe847e88) at ../src/nvim/normal.c:8140\r\n#5  0x0000aaaac3d06640 in normal_execute (state=0xfffffe847df8, key=<optimized out>) at ../src/nvim/normal.c:1148\r\n...\r\n(gdb) f 3\r\n#3  0x0000aaaac3dbc50c in state_handle_k_event () at ../src/nvim/state.c:87\r\n87            event.handler(event.argv);\r\n(gdb) p ((Channel*)event.argv[0]).stream.proc.in.pending_reqs\r\n$67 = 1\r\n(gdb) p ((Channel*)event.argv[0]).stream.proc.in.closed\r\n$68 = true\r\n(gdb) down\r\n#2  0x0000aaaac3bdec10 in term_delayed_free (argv=<optimized out>) at ../src/nvim/channel.c:778\r\n778         multiqueue_put(chan->events, term_delayed_free, 1, chan);\r\n(gdb) l\r\n773\r\n774     static inline void term_delayed_free(void **argv)\r\n775     {\r\n776       Channel *chan = argv[0];\r\n777       if (chan->stream.proc.in.pending_reqs || chan->stream.proc.out.pending_reqs) {\r\n778         multiqueue_put(chan->events, term_delayed_free, 1, chan);\r\n779         return;\r\n780       }\r\n781\r\n782       terminal_destroy(chan->term);\r\n```",
